Proxy the workspace file index for the composer's fuzzy "@" picker.

Adds GET /v1/sessions/{id}/resources/environments/{env}/file-index, which
authorizes like the other filesystem reads and proxies to the runner's
route from images/runner/patches/0006-mention-file-index.patch. There is no
host fallback: with the runner offline, the web UI goes back to browsing
one folder at a time. Hidden from the public API reference. Pairs with the
web patch 0014-composer-fuzzy-mentions.patch.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d), after 0001-0010.

